      "simplified": "客户：你好，我想找一套房子。",
      "traditional": "客戶：你好，我想找一套房子。",
      "pinyin": "kè hù nǐ hǎo wǒ xiǎng zhǎo yí tào fáng zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Client: Hi, I am looking for an apartment."
    },
