      "traditional": "中介：您是租房還是買房？",
      "pinyin": "zhōng jiè nín shì zū fáng hái shi mǎi fáng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Agent: Would you like to buy or rent?"
    },
    {
